<!doctype html>
<html lang="nb">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
{{template "head" .Meta}}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{asset "/static/css/analyse.css"}}">
</head>
<body class="no-js" data-page="resultat">
<script>document.body.classList.remove('no-js')</script>

{{template "header"}}

<main>
  <span class="snapshot-badge">Øyeblikksbilde: hendelser til og med {{.SnapshotDate}}</span>

  {{/* Own page, not an in-page tab (2026-09-26): a result you can link
       to, bookmark, or find again via the nav, not something buried
       behind a click inside the quiz. Still purely client-side —
       nothing here ever reaches the server; quiz.js reads the same
       answers from localStorage that the quiz itself writes. */}}
  <p class="lede">
    Resultatet ditt, regnet ut fra svarene du har gitt i
    <a href="/">valgomaten</a>. Det oppdateres etter hvert svar, og lever
    bare i denne nettleseren.
  </p>

  <noscript>
    <div class="card no-js-notice">
      <p>
        Resultatet krever JavaScript. Svarene dine lagres bare i
        nettleseren din, ikke på en server, så det finnes ingenting å
        regne ut her uten JavaScript. Du kan fortsatt
        <a href="/">svare på utsagnene</a> eller lese kilden bak hvert
        enkelt utsagn.
      </p>
    </div>
  </noscript>

  <div id="storage-note" class="js-only" role="status"></div>
  <div id="quiz-root" class="js-only"></div>

  {{/* "Hvorfor dette resultatet?" robustness panel (2026-10-12). Its own
       container, mounted by analyse.js, NOT injected into #quiz-root —
       quiz.js owns that element and re-renders it on every change.
       Collapsed behind one native <details> (built in analyse.js) so a
       first-time visitor still meets a clean result first. Hidden without
       JS, where there is nothing to compute (see the <noscript> above). */}}
  <section id="analyse-root" class="js-only" aria-label="Analyse av resultatet"></section>
</main>

<footer class="site">
  <p>
    Ingen svar fra brukere lagres eller sendes til en server. Bygget {{year}}.
    <a href="/personvern">Personvern <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </p>
  <p>
    Lisensiert under
    <a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html">GNU AGPL-3.0</a>.
    Kildekoden er åpen:
    <a href="https://github.com/jkorsvik/ektevalgomat">github.com/jkorsvik/ektevalgomat</a>.
    Kjører du en endret versjon offentlig, skal koden din også være det.
  </p>
</footer>

<script id="ektevalgomat-data" type="application/json">{{.PayloadJSON}}</script>
<script src="{{asset "/static/js/scoring.js"}}"></script>
<script src="{{asset "/static/js/store.js"}}"></script>
<script src="{{asset "/static/js/avveining.js"}}"></script>
<script src="{{asset "/static/js/quiz.js"}}"></script>
{{/* analyse.js runs after quiz.js: quiz.js migrates stale stored answers
     first, and analyse.js reads the same map from localStorage. */}}
<script src="{{asset "/static/js/analyse.js"}}"></script>
</body>
</html>
